  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flood and Early Warning Research to improve early warning of tropical cyclone and fluvial flood risks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This research aims to improve early warning of flood impacts from tropical cyclone and fluvial flood events by improving the forecasting and packaging of this information for humanitarian response actors enabling earlier preparedness and improved responses when flood events occur.</narrative>
  </description>
